### How do you monitor and manage partition count in production?

Monitor broker-level metrics for total partitions, under-replicated partitions, and consumer lag. Alert when any broker approaches the practical ceiling. Use the reassignment tool to rebalance partitions across brokers after adding capacity.

```bash
# Check total partitions per broker
kafka-broker-api-versions.sh --bootstrap-server kafka-1:9092

# Monitor consumer lag per partition
kafka-consumer-groups.sh --describe --group settlement-service \
  --bootstrap-server kafka-1:9092
```

